  "spectral_obstruction": "The constant field Rayleigh quotient equals 10 Nportal/L\u00b2. It is an upper bound on the physical ground eigenvalue, NOT an exact mass. Local wavefunctions can avoid large site potentials. The single-defect finite-size T-matrix approx c*10/(1+10*G_L) is motivated by resolvent resummation but not proven for this random finite-density graph.",
